{"seq":7,"slug":"macroeconomics","title":"宏观经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"宏观经济学-简介\">宏观经济学 简介</h1><p>宏观经济学以<strong>总量视角</strong>研究一国经济的整体运行：产出（GDP）、物价（通胀）、就业、增长与对外经济关系。它回答的是&quot;经济为何会衰退&quot;&quot;加息如何影响投资&quot;&quot;逆差是否危险&quot;这类系统性问题，而非单个市场或个体的决策。</p>\n<p>本手册面向希望理解宏观运行逻辑的技术从业者与程序员——掌握它，能帮你读懂利率与政策变化对行业估值、就业与投资的传导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>经济金融大类下相邻 hub 众多，宏观经济学是&quot;总量与政策&quot;的中枢，与下列 hub 边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>关注层次</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../microeconomics/\">微观经济学</a></td>\n<td>单个市场、个体决策</td>\n<td>微观讲供需与厂商行为；宏观把这些加总为总需求/总供给</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../monetary-policy-central-banking/\">货币政策与中央银行</a></td>\n<td>央行工具与传导（深）</td>\n<td>本 hub 给货币政策的总量框架；该 hub 深入 QE、利率走廊、CBDC 等工具细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../international-economics/\">国际经济学</a></td>\n<td>贸易与国际金融（深）</td>\n<td>本 hub 第四章是国际宏观的入门；该 hub 系统展开比较优势、汇率定价、资本流动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../labor-economics/\">劳动经济学</a></td>\n<td>劳动力市场微观机制</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲失业总量与菲利普斯曲线；该 hub 讲搜寻匹配、工资决定的微观基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../development-economics/\">发展经济学</a></td>\n<td>长期发展与制度</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲增长模型与决定因素；该 hub 聚焦贫困、制度质量与发展路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../econometrics/\">计量经济学</a></td>\n<td>实证方法</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供理论；该 hub 提供检验理论、预测 GDP/通胀的统计工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../public-economics/\">公共经济学</a></td>\n<td>政府收支微观效率</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲财政政策的总量效应；该 hub 讲税收设计与公共品供给效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 是总量经济学的主干，相邻 hub 是它各个分支的深化。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按章节顺序学习；不同人群侧重不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零基础 / 通识读者</strong>：先读<a href=\"../microeconomics/\">微观经济学</a>建立供需直觉 → 第一章宏观指标 → 第三章货币与财政政策。重在理解概念，可跳过增长模型的数学推导。</li>\n<li><strong>技术从业者 / 投资视角</strong>：第一章（看懂 GDP、CPI、失业数据）→ 第三章第 2 篇<a href=\"monetary-and-fiscal-policy/interest-rate-and-monetary-transmission\">利率与货币政策传导</a>（利率如何影响科技股估值）→ 第四章<a href=\"international-macroeconomics/exchange-rate-regimes\">汇率制度</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>系统学习者</strong>：四章顺序通读，再沿每篇末尾&quot;延伸阅读&quot;进入<a href=\"../monetary-policy-central-banking/\">货币政策</a>、<a href=\"../international-economics/\">国际经济学</a>、<a href=\"../econometrics/\">计量经济学</a>深化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：<a href=\"../microeconomics/\">微观经济学</a>的供需与均衡概念（理解总需求/总供给的微观来源）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章建议</strong>：基本的代数与函数概念（索洛模型涉及生产函数与稳态求解）。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章建议</strong>：先有第一章国际收支的基础，再进入汇率与全球金融体系。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶实证</strong>：若想把理论用于数据，需要<a href=\"../econometrics/\">计量经济学</a>的回归与时间序列方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 宏观经济指标</strong>：GDP 核算、通胀与价格指数、失业与劳动力市场、国际收支——理解后续理论的数据基础。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 经济增长理论</strong>：索洛模型、内生增长、经济周期、长期增长决定因素——长期与波动两条主线。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 货币与财政政策</strong>：货币供给、利率传导、财政乘数、政策协调——短期调控的工具箱。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 国际宏观经济</strong>：贸易理论、汇率制度、全球金融体系——开放经济的扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macroeconomic-indicators","title":"宏观经济指标","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdp-and-economic-measurement","title":"GDP 与经济核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/gdp-and-economic-measurement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inflation-and-price-index","title":"通货膨胀与价格指数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/inflation-and-price-index"},{"seq":3,"slug":"unemployment-and-labor-market","title":"失业与劳动力市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/unemployment-and-labor-market"},{"seq":4,"slug":"balance-of-payments","title":"国际收支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/macroeconomic-indicators/balance-of-payments"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-growth-theory","title":"经济增长理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solow-growth-model","title":"索洛增长模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory/solow-growth-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"endogenous-growth-theory","title":"内生增长理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory/endogenous-growth-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-cycle-and-fluctuation","title":"经济周期与波动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory/economic-cycle-and-fluctuation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"long-run-growth-determinants","title":"长期增长的决定因素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory/long-run-growth-determinants"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"monetary-and-fiscal-policy","title":"货币与财政政策","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"money-supply-and-central-banking","title":"货币供给与中央银行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy/money-supply-and-central-banking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interest-rate-and-monetary-transmission","title":"利率与货币政策传导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy/interest-rate-and-monetary-transmission"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fiscal-policy-and-government-spending","title":"财政政策与政府支出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy/fiscal-policy-and-government-spending"},{"seq":4,"slug":"policy-coordination-and-tradeoffs","title":"政策协调与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/monetary-and-fiscal-policy/policy-coordination-and-tradeoffs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"international-macroeconomics","title":"国际宏观经济","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"international-trade-theory","title":"国际贸易理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics/international-trade-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exchange-rate-regimes","title":"汇率制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics/exchange-rate-regimes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-financial-system","title":"全球金融体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics/global-financial-system"}]}]}